# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository AND in checkouts.
#
# Every source file in this project is authored with LF endings, and the
# measured checks (B2 assembler grid, B3 linker, B4 runtime) compare byte
# sequences against GNU as+ld. A CRLF checkout would change those bytes and
# invalidate the results, so LF is enforced everywhere.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts - never touched by line-ending conversion.
*.elf binary
*.o binary
*.bin binary
*.safetensors binary
*.gguf binary
*.zip binary
